& \therefore \quad \frac{3}{2} n R \Delta T=\frac{1}{2}\mathrm{mnV}^2 \\
& \therefore \quad \Delta \mathrm{ T}$=$\frac{\mathrm{mV}^2}{3 \mathrm{R}}
\end{aligned}$

